 S political polarization and strengthening social cohesion.\n\nOrganisatio
 n: Carnegie Corporation of New York\nLocation: US. For US-based scholars\,
  journalists\, authors and public intellectuals\; candidates must be nomin
 ated by their institution (direct applications are not accepted).\nAward: 
