SUMMARY:Deadline: Fonds Soziokultur: General Project Funding\, November 202
 6 round (Allgemeine Projektfoerderung)
DESCRIPTION:Twice-yearly open round of Germany's federal fund for participa
 tory and sociocultural arts projects: community-rooted work that uses arti
 stic means (performance\, media\, music\, visual art\, digital culture) to
  engage people in social questions. Strong fit for artist collectives and 
 small cultural organisations doing participatory\, socially engaged or civ
 ic-media work in Germany.\n\nOrganisation: Fonds Soziokultur\nLocation: Ge
 rmany. Projects must take place in Germany\; applicant groups need at leas
 t three members resident in Germany.\nAward: EUR 5\,000 to EUR 30\,000 per
  project\, covering at most 80 percent of the total project budget. No app
