 d dinner + compute.\nDuration: 15 weeks full-time (18 January to 30 April 
 2027)\n\nMore: https://www.pivotal-research.org/fellowships/ai-safety-fell
 owship?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
