 eracy call (CREA-CROSS-2027-MEDIALITERACY) funds cross-border actions that
  build media literacy and resilience to disinformation\, with attention to
  countries facing particular media literacy challenges. WHO: consortia of 
 at least three entities from three eligible Creative Europe countries\; in
 dividuals cannot apply.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe Cross-sectoral st
 rand (European Commission / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Member States and countri
 es associated to Creative Europe. For organisations (legal entities) estab
 lished in an eligible country\; natural persons cannot apply.\nAward: Up t
 o EUR 500\,000 per project at a 70 percent funding rate\; total call budge
 t EUR 3\,500\,000. No application fee.\nDuration: Projects normally up to 
 24 months. Call opened 22 October 2026.\n\nMore: https://ec.europa.eu/info
 /funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/opportunities/topic-details/C
 REA-CROSS-2027-MEDIALITERACY?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
