 2027 (up to EUR 120\,000 plus EUR 60\,000 per extra partner\, film\, serie
 s and immersive)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 02 Mar 2027 at 17:00 CET.\n\nThe MEDIA Co-Development ca
 ll (CREA-MEDIA-2027-CODEV) supports European independent production compan
 ies developing a work together: feature films\, shorts\, series\, creative
  documentaries and narrative VR or immersive projects intended for cross-b
 order audiences.\n\nOrganisation: Creative Europe MEDIA (European Commissi
 on / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to 
 Creative Europe MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in a
  MEDIA country\; natural persons cannot apply. Consortia of at least two i
 ndependent production companies from two MEDIA countries.\nAward: Lump sum
  at a 70 percent funding rate: up to EUR 120\,000 for a two-partner consor
 tium plus EUR 60\,000 per additional partner\; high-budget drama series (E
 UR 20 million or more) up to EUR 200\,000 plus EUR 100\,000 per additional
  partner. Total call budget EUR 12\,500\,000. No application fee.\nDuratio
 n: Projects normally up to 30 months. Call opened 30 September 2026.\n\nMo
 re: https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/
 opportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-CODEV?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/o
 pportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-CODEV?utm_source=artificialnouv
 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative Europe
  MEDIA. For organisations (legal entities) established in a MEDIA country\
 ; natural persons cannot apply. Consortia of at least two independent prod
 uction companies from two MEDIA countries.
