 rk or work in progress that can be shown in the festival's site-specific s
 paces.\n\nOrganisation: Hidden Door Festival\nLocation: Edinburgh\, Scotla
 nd (in person\; venue to be announced\, festival anticipated early June 20
 27). Open to artists based wholly or partly in Scotland\, or graduates of 
 a Scottish art school within the last three years.\nAward: Up to GBP 1\,50
 0 per artwork/application\, covering all artist fees and expenses\, budget
 ed against Scottish Artists' Union rates (most awards will be lower). No a
 pplication fee.\nDuration: Festival\, early June 2027\n\nMore: https://hid
 dendoorarts.org/call-for-submissions/hidden-door-2027-visual-art-open-call
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
